Embedded typeface
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

main/font_serif.c contains a bitmap rendering of Noto Serif, generated by
tools/mkfont.py from assets/NotoSerif-source.ttf.

  Noto Serif
  Copyright (c) The Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic)
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
  https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

The OFL permits redistribution and embedding, including in commercial work.
The bitmap table is regenerable from the source face; it is not hand-drawn and
carries no separate claim.

main/font5x7.c is an original 5x7 bitmap font written for this project and
carries no third-party licence.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Everything else
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

All firmware in this repository is original work. The signal families
implement behaviour defined by the IEEE 802.11 and Bluetooth Core
specifications -- publicly documented protocol mechanics -- and no third-party
source is vendored or adapted.
